@page "/non-residential"

<PageTitle>Non-residential lockout - University of Virginia Facilities Management - Customer Portal</PageTitle>

<div class="container">
    <h2>Non-Residential lock-out/Non-Residential lost key</h2>
    <p>If you are locked out of your office, please call Grounds/Hospital Security at <span class="bold">(434) 924-5048</span>.</p>
    <p>You must present your UVA ID.</p>
    <p>To report a lost or stolen key, that does not require a replacement, please call the Customer Support Center at <span class="bold">(434) 924-1777</span>. You may be asked to file a police report with UPD or another agency if not on grounds.</p>
    <p>To report a lost or stolen key, that does require a replacement, please <a href="requestor">submit a request</a> to replace the key with required information, which may require a police report number.</p>
</div>